  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-08-07T16:31:14.388Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As of the latest VRChat update [2021.3.2][1121] the \"VRChat Configuration Window\" cannot be opened anymore and this was the only way to rebind joystick inputs (as far as I know).\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-configuration-window\nUnity blog post explaining the situation\nhttps://blog.unity.com/technology/introducing-unity-2019-1#display\n\"Display Resolution Dialog aka. Screen Selector has been disabled by default since 2019.3\"\nI've tried adding command line argument \"-show-screen-selector\" but the configuration window still doesn't appear.\nMy Udon Vehicles heavily rely on the ability to bind steering wheel setups to existing input axes in VRChat and as of now I don't know any way to do this anymore.",
